## Business Domain

An enterprise knowledge management platform indexes internal documents—including engineering specifications, HR policies, legal contracts, financial procedures, and operational manuals—to provide fast full-text search across the organization.

Employees never query the primary document repository directly. Instead, all search requests are served from a dedicated search index built from canonical enterprise documents.

