Application ID: scenario_090

## Description

Large satellite operators schedule communication windows using an event-driven workflow. A ground station cannot transmit simply because a reservation exists — every reservation has to progress through a chain of immutable workflow stages before it becomes operational:

```
Reservation Request
        │
        ▼
Reservation Approved
        │
        ▼
ReservationGrantedEvent
        │
        ▼
ReservationProjection
        │
        ▼
OperationalReservation
        │
        ▼
SchedulingPlanner
        │
        ▼
TransmissionSchedule
        │
        ▼
SchedulerQueue
        │
        ▼
Ground Station Runtime
        │
        ▼
Satellite Communication
```

Everything downstream trusts the stage before it. Nothing re-checks authorization against the original approval once it has entered the pipeline.


