Application ID: scenario_004

## Technology Stack

- React
- Node.js
- MongoDB
- Python
- Docker

## Description

The application allows users to upload resumes which are processed
by an AI analysis service.

Generated reports are stored and later viewed through the frontend.

The platform also supports importing report metadata from external
backup systems.

Imported metadata is trusted and stored directly in MongoDB.

When reports are viewed, the backend retrieves the stored reportPath
and forwards it to a Python processing service which loads the
corresponding report from disk.

The processor constructs filesystem paths using os.path.join()
without validating the final resolved path.

An attacker can poison report metadata and cause the processor
to access files outside the intended report directory.

## Normal Flow

Upload Resume
→ AI Analysis
→ Generate Report
→ Store Metadata
→ View Report


